tests/errors/return.gael:3:25: error: return cannot leave an arena; let the arena end, then return
tests/errors/return.gael:4:19: error: this function returns unit, so its return takes no value: (return)
tests/errors/return.gael:5:18: error: this function returns a value: (return x)
tests/errors/return.gael:6:26: error: return: this function returns int, the value is string
tests/errors/return.gael:8:27: error: return cannot be among the fields of a struct being made
